# Vite writes its build into dist/, and resources/embed.go compiles that whole
# directory into the binary. It is generated output rather than source, so it
# is not committed — but the directory itself has to survive, because an embed
# directive that matches nothing is a compile error and a fresh clone would
# then need Node before it could build any Go at all.
dist/*
!dist/.gitkeep

node_modules/

# Vite's own caches.
.vite/
*.local
